    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d284">

                <pb facs="0332" n="248" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg248"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Navy Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Washington, D.
                                C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1903-11-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 3,
                    1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consul</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Panama:</hi></p>
                <p>Message sent <hi rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi> to Colon may not have been
                    delivered. Accordingly see that the following message is sent to <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi> immediately: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nashville</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Colon:</hi></p>
                        <p>In the interest of peace make every effort to prevent Government troops
                            at Colon from proceeding to Panama. The transit of the Isthmus must be
                            kept open and order maintained. Acknowledge.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Darling</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Acting.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Secure special trains if necessary. Act promptly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
